  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease. 5.0.0 is a breaking release that removes the provider SDK from the public API. Chat messages are now Ouroboros' own OuroMessage/OuroRole instead of Betalgo's ChatMessage, and reasoning effort is OuroReasoningEffort. Adds IOuroClient as a mocking seam. Removes the legacy text-completions API (CompleteAsync, CompleteOptions, gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct), GetInnerClient, and the sampling parameters current reasoning models reject. TokenCount now requires a model and uses the correct encoding. See MIGRATION_4.4_to_5.0.md.",
